      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we check the return value from `af_xdp_enter_netns()` before querying or detaching the program? If the target namespace cannot be entered, this continues in the caller\u0027s namespace using `ad-\u003elinux_ifindex`, which could detach an unrelated XDP program with the same numeric ifindex.",
